  "short_description": "<p>Handwoven rattan tray with elegant mother of pearl inlay, made in Vietnam. Ideal for serving or decoration, crafted from sustainable materials.</p>",
  "description": "<div class=\"video video-fit mb\" style=\"padding-top:56.25%\"><p></p>\n</div>\n<p data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"179\">Discover handmade <strong data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1441\">rattan trays with mother of pearl inlay from Vietnam</strong>. Sustainable, eco-friendly, and perfect for wholesale, retail, or home décor.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"179\"><strong data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"177\">Product Description</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"571\">This <strong data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"243\">handwoven rattan tray with mother of pearl (MOP) inlay</strong> is a masterpiece of Vietnamese craftsmanship. Skilled artisans carefully braid natural rattan into a strong yet lightweight frame, then adorn it with shimmering seashell inlay for a luxurious finish. The combination of earthy textures and elegant shell details makes this tray perfect for <strong data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"568\">serving, home décor, or gifting</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"860\">Each tray reflects the dedication of Vietnamese craft villages, where traditional weaving skills are passed down through generations. By choosing this tray, you not only bring a <strong data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"782\">unique eco-friendly product</strong> into your home but also support sustainable livelihoods for rural artisans.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"865\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"889\"><strong data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"887\">Key Features</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"1153\">\n<li data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"945\">\n<p data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"945\">Material: Natural rattan with mother of pearl inlay</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"995\">\n<p data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"995\">Finish: Handwoven and polished for durability</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1052\">\n<p data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1052\">Usage: Serving tray, decorative tray, or centerpiece</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1109\">\n<p data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1109\">Eco-friendly: 100% natural and sustainable materials</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1153\">\n<p data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1153\">Handmade in Vietnam by skilled artisans</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1521\">",
